  "description": "PostgreSQL provider for the Elarion.Migrations SQL migration engine (ADR-0057/ADR-0060), for EF-free (NativeAOT) hosts: embedded V{version}__/R__ scripts, SHA-256 checksums over line-ending-normalized content, a session-level pg_advisory_lock, and history rows that commit in the same transaction as their script — so there is no repair command and no failed-row limbo. Startup-applied via a hosted service. The EF tier keeps EF Core migrations.",
